<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 5.995 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 5.995 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.857 / 5.995 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    101.75 to 101.90</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.85</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     67.735</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  10.025 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   19.125 billion francs</p>
<p>* 4.00 pct, January 2000 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield    99.950 / 4.014 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	     99.85 to 99.95</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price  99.95</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop	100</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		   12.790 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	    34.590 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
